  ],
  "key_parameters": [
    "Pivot: local pivot for transformations",
    "Translate, Rotate (degrees), Uniform Scale, Scale (non-uniform): core transform controls",
    "Randomize group: Offset, Rotation, Uniform Scaling, Scale Min/Max, Uniform Scale Min/Max, Seed",
    "Fitting Method: None, Frame (uniform fit) or Stretch (non-uniform fit) to a rectangle set by Center and Size; per UV island when a seed input is connected"
  ],
  "caveats": [
    "The node does not move pixels; it only changes the UV values each pixel represents"
  ],
  "resume_fr": "Transforme les valeurs UV (translation, rotation, échelle) sans déplacer les pixels, avec une randomisation optionnelle par îlot grâce à l'entrée seed."
